{"steam_appid":3176060,"steam_name":"Emissary Zero","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3176060/858638/1a05e5b7df7a192b1abf572e731732d5aca895e9/1750824548/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743068836","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119060/c9a02e6ddbf6091de2f1bae5725b30157afa709f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743068836","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/ss_87add699eb75fc323e6a04b9a89c074a5f41451d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774701242","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/c462bfbfe70af82010f006b99f2867f6c3812a76/ss_c462bfbfe70af82010f006b99f2867f6c3812a76.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774701242","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/ss_72363f937904e17e33cbd92fc679dc63006425fb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774701242","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/d47e6983dd4884abb1f95dcfd15b5ec923f69fb8/ss_d47e6983dd4884abb1f95dcfd15b5ec923f69fb8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774701242","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/ss_1b7d73db97c9e384fae50c3c66c8953fb3dc7395.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774701242"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent to explore a mysterious building at night. Only your manager will support you, the rest you have to do yourself. Find the Moon and try to return alive. Play single or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/9d7e78f1ff2414725f49ccbab49d18e6.poster.avif?t=1774701242\" width=610 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/9d7e78f1ff2414725f49ccbab49d18e6.webm?t=1774701242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/9d7e78f1ff2414725f49ccbab49d18e6.mp4?t=1774701242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various creepy monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a company  online (up to 4 people) or with splitscreen multiplayer (up to 2 people).   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large changing location with lots of exploration. Explore the area and complete tasks.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/f0197cdd6632f883a6de2b8f70598dfb.poster.avif?t=1774701242\" width=610 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/f0197cdd6632f883a6de2b8f70598dfb.webm?t=1774701242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/f0197cdd6632f883a6de2b8f70598dfb.mp4?t=1774701242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources: find, move, repair, connect, observe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Communicate via voice chat in the game online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is being developed by one person. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/d607902d3c990b7d20a11d5f6ab1d9a7.poster.avif?t=1774701242\" width=610 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/d607902d3c990b7d20a11d5f6ab1d9a7.webm?t=1774701242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176060/extras/d607902d3c990b7d20a11d5f6ab1d9a7.mp4?t=1774701242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GEFORCE GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The system requirements listed above apply to playing on a flat-screen monitor. VR requires higher specifications.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I7-8700K or AMD RYZEN 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GEFORCE GTX 1070 8 GB or AMD RADEON RX VEGA 56 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The system requirements listed above apply to playing on a flat-screen monitor. VR requires higher specifications.</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Massively Multiplayer"],"developers":["Rone Vine"],"publishers":["Rone Vine"],"release_date":"28 Mar, 2025"}